<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria court declares Mineralbank insolvent.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria court declares Mineralbank insolvent.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sofia City Court on Monday declared state-owned Mineralbank insolvent at the request of the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB), state radio said.</p>
<p>This is the first large state-owned local bank ruled insolvent out of 16 banks for which the BNB has sought insolvency. Mineralbank can appeal against the ruling.</p>
</text>
